      <div type="layout" source="#source-68547-69068" style="padding-inline-start: 2em">
        <p><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-68582-68606"><rb>執術</rb><rt>トルワザ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-68606-68618"><rb>之</rb><rt>ノ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-68618-68651"><rb>鈍有丹</rb><rt>ニブカラムニ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-68651-68663"><rb>波</rb><rt>ハ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-68663-68666">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-68666-68678"><rb>目</rb><rt>メ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-68678-68702"><rb>炎曜</rb><rt>カヾヤク</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-68702-68705">　</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-68705-68735"><rb>金造</rb><rt>コガネヅクリ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-68735-68747"><rb>之</rb><rt>ノ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-68747-68765"><rb>大刀</rb><rt>タチ</rt></ruby><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-68765-68777"><rb>毛</rb><rt>モ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-68777-68780">、</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-68780-68807"><rb>何将為</rb><rt>ナニセム</rt></ruby></p>
